contract Payment
parties we, payer

thing Bill
  amount HKD

can settle by payer
  over 10_000 requires in person
  open -> cleared

test "a small bill is paid"
  we create with amount = HKD 500
  payer settle -> cleared

test "a large bill needs the payer in person"
  we create with amount = HKD 50_000
  payer settle -> refused "bo:in-person settle"

test "and in person it is paid"
  we create with amount = HKD 50_000
  payer settle in person -> cleared
